{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a hand-drawn and animated world where your mission is simple: <strong>find all the cats!</strong> Explore lively environments, trigger surprising interactions, and keep your eyes peeled to spot every detail. Observation is key to uncover these mischievous felines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.poster.avif?t=1758653465\" width=800 height=531 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.webm?t=1758653465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip through the pages of a notebook and explore around 30 different levels over the course of approximately 2 hours, gradually filling your wagons with all the cats you discover.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful \u2014 time is ticking. Once a level starts, you only have a short while before the storm catches up. Thankfully, some characters are there to help, and a hint system is available if you get stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you manage to find them all, a final challenge awaits: a hidden mystery object has been placed in each level \u2014 can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the creators of <i>Oddada</i>, a game that made it possible for me to compose the entire soundtrack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324060?t=1758653465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324060?t=1758653465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/4c159877596852ff977219ce9673e78a33a55e92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758653465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/4c159877596852ff977219ce9673e78a33a55e92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758653465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a hand-drawn and animated world where your mission is simple: <strong>find all the cats!</strong> Explore lively environments, trigger surprising interactions, and keep your eyes peeled to spot every detail. Observation is key to uncover these mischievous felines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.poster.avif?t=1758653465\" width=800 height=531 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.webm?t=1758653465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip through the pages of a notebook and explore around 30 different levels over the course of approximately 2 hours, gradually filling your wagons with all the cats you discover.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful \u2014 time is ticking. Once a level starts, you only have a short while before the storm catches up. Thankfully, some characters are there to help, and a hint system is available if you get stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you manage to find them all, a final challenge awaits: a hidden mystery object has been placed in each level \u2014 can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the creators of <i>Oddada</i>, a game that made it possible for me to compose the entire soundtrack.</p>","developers":["Balgrime Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/header.jpg?t=1758653465","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324060/813991/a629867f425e311993a59abef85f4504d3536ea9/1750870132/dash_av1.mpd?t=1737099300","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324060/813991/a629867f425e311993a59abef85f4504d3536ea9/1750870132/dash_h264.mpd?t=1737099300","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324060/813991/a629867f425e311993a59abef85f4504d3536ea9/1750870132/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1737099300","id":257089689,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089689/movie480.mp4?t=1737099300","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089689/movie_max.mp4?t=1737099300"},"name":"Trailer Seek and Click","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257089689/5dcb974ea585b9346f4d5759a34a1762c3f9ae87/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737099300","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089689/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737099300","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089689/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1737099300"}}],"name":"Seek and Click","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</stro